From cdf2b8eb04523d02a271fbd666e91a1c77980e78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:30:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Difficulty pass 1: level curve, trainer IVs and AI

Trainer and Johto wild levels follow the hack's curve (tools/hack/
levels.py): Johto and the first Elite Four round ramp up to 1.15x,
Kanto and the post-game rematch teams are 1.3x, the second Elite Four
round 1.2x and Red +7. Every trainer Pokemon has at least 150/255 IVs,
bosses have the maximum, and every trainer uses the smart AI flags.
Generated by tools/hack/difficulty.py and tools/hack/wild_levels.py.
---
